<h1>About Us</h1>
</header>
<main class="text-white">
  <p>Welcome to Used Books Online, your one-stop shop for quality used books! We were founded by not particularly a book lover who, frankly, was too lazy to go out and sell his used books in person. So, he decided to create an online marketplace where he could sell his books from the comfort of his own home. And thus, Used Books Online was born!</p>
  <p>Our mission is to make buying and selling used books as easy and convenient as possible. We know that there are a lot of used book enthusiasts out there who don't have the time or energy to go to physical bookstores or flea markets to find what they're looking for. That's where we come in. Our online store is open 24/7, so you can browse and purchase books at your leisure.</p>
  <p>At Used Books Online, we pride ourselves on offering a wide selection of high-quality used books at affordable prices. We carefully inspect all of our books before putting them up for sale, so you can trust that you're getting a good deal on a book that's in great condition. We also offer a variety of shipping options to ensure that your books arrive quickly and securely.</p>
  <p>Currently we are only serving only selected places in MNNIT Allhabad Campus, if you want us to increase our reach</p>
  <p>You can help us either by delivering books or selling your books <a href="/join_us">Join Us!</a></p>
  <p>Thank you for choosing Used Books Online for all of your used book needs. Happy reading!</p>
</main>

